{"id":"d921a1cb4f0e3fc8","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-countable-support.md","title":"Countable Support","display":"df-countable-support — Countable Support","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-countable-support","aliases":["58-df-countable-support"],"display":"df-countable-support — Countable Support","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-countable.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-countable-support"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-countable-support</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-countable-support — Countable Support"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md\">../batch15/58-df-forcing.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,\\gamma\\in V\">\\(p,\\gamma\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\mathbb P_\\alpha,\\dot{\\mathbb Q}_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\gamma\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\mathbb P_\\alpha,\\dot{\\mathbb Q}_\\alpha:\\alpha&lt;\\gamma\\rangle\\)</span> (forcing-iteration data)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Countable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\)</span> (countability predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1b3610e6aed65b25\" href=\"?note=1b3610e6aed65b25\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-countable.md\">../batch14/58-df-countable.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableSupport}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableSupport}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countable-support} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableSupport}_S(p,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\gamma:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P_\\alpha}\\}\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}countable-support} \\vdash \\mathrm{CountableSupport}_S(p,\\gamma)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Countable}_S\\bigl(\\{\\alpha\\in\\gamma:p(\\alpha)\\neq\\mathbb 1_{\\mathbb P_\\alpha}\\}\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Countable-support iterations of proper forcing notions preserve <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span>; countable support alone does not imply this preservation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_o